.DS_Store
node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.claude/*
# Durable artefacts are committed with the code they govern: the profile the
# pipeline resolves, the articles it enforces, the units of work and the
# evidence behind each verdict. Ignoring them would make status.yml a source of
# truth only this checkout can see.
!.claude/profile.yml
!.claude/governance/
!.claude/specs/
!.claude/runs/
# Transit artefacts stay out — their durable home is the tracker or the PR.
.claude/prompts/
.claude/validations/
.claude/pr-templates/
.claude/qa-handoff/
*.log
